{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120123355974-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120123907\"/><p>案件於九龍城裁判法院提堂。</p><p>深水埗區警員經深入調查後，昨日(19日)在區內進行打擊毒品行動。人員在兩個用作毒品倉庫的唐樓單位，檢獲約3.2公斤懷疑氯胺酮及約830克懷疑可卡因。兩次行動中檢獲的毒品總市值約200萬元。</p><p>該名被捕男子已被暫控兩項「販運危險藥物」罪，案件將於今日(20日)下午在九龍城裁判法院提堂。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:03:54.519231+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:33:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:19.843707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:57:26.387589+00:00","content_hash":"dc648ef4d7f3e95470cceffeb5fb49324fd21f5a412385bc2252c772bb6fc5c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}